ar culture  such as music and people's clothing  which is strange to him the doctor buys  ice cream and leonard eats it on the  same bench where he engraved his name 30  years ago  after that leonard goes into the water  and even though the doctor doesn't think  he's ready for it we see him climb on a  rock to finally enjoy being alive the  doctor takes him home where leonard  notices that he is not married he  replies that he's not very good with  women although he does like them and  leonard says that he knows he likes a  hospital nurse named eleanor upon  returning to the hospital his boss tells  him that they cannot continue this  treatment for long as it is very  expensive  the doctor believes that he can convince  donors at the hospital to give more  money if they found out about leonard's  case the boss says he overestimates the  effect leonard has on people  but then he sees that even the hospital  nurses are willing to help  then the doctor convinces more people to  join the motion showing them leonard's  story  thereby raising enough money to apply  the treatment to all the other patients  and the great miracle happens one more  time we see how all the people who had  not been able to move in years get up  from their beds and rediscover the world  surprised that they have awakened from  their lathargy leonard celebrates this  achievement with a smile and in the  morning we see that the nurses have a  hard time managing all the new patients  one patient believes that everything she  lived through was just a dream another  wants to put makeup on and dye her hair  another wants to eat a good steak and in  general all patients are happy simply to  be alive although they are not even  aware what year it is one of the  patients even meets her boyfriend again  and then the doctor organizes an outing  with all the patients although leonard  does not want to go because he sees a  pretty girl at the hospital suddenly  leonard also worries a lot about his  hairstyle 