r  caused security to prevent him from  leaving so leonard ends up with tears  for not being able to be free the mother  says that he had never been this  disobedient as a child while we see  leonard trying to riot with other  patients but also he begins to have  movement problems while giving his  speech  the boss says that leonard's anger may  be due to his mental problems although  the doctor defends him saying that he  behaves like this because he took him  out of his mental confinement to detain  him in another confinement within the  hospital then he goes to talk to leonard  who has other patients as his personal  guards leonardo allows him to pass and  the doctor sees that his movement  problems are getting worse however  leonard says that he is the one with the  problem since although he has always  been alive and conscious he has never  worried about having a life or getting  married the doctor warns him that if he  continues to be rude the other doctors  may suspend his medication but leonard  still very angrily pushes him that night  leonard regrets his actions and even  fixes the glasses that the doctor broke  with the fall and in the morning his  condition has worsened so much  that he asked the doctor to help him  stand up they realized that the  medication only had a temporary effect  on leonard as he is returning to his  state of prostration even though they  haven't stopped giving him his medicine  and other patients worry the same thing  will happen to them a patient named lucy  who sings beautifully says that she is  already aware that she is not in her  time  and that she still misses it anyway  leonard is scared to return to his  previous state the doctor continues with  his medication and leonard explains that  while he was in lathargy he felt as if  he were dead and we see that he can no  longer even brush his teeth then one day  leonard begins to feel very bad and  asked to be recorded so that there is  evidence of his symptoms for future  research  the doctor increases his dose more and  more while leonard is sad because he can  no longer even read he believes that he  is failing everyone by not being able to  overcome his illness even though the  doctor tells him that he is not  leonard's mother says that her son's  suffering should be stopped as the  medicine no longer fully works on him  regardless of the dose the doctor  replies that her son is fighting to  overcome this illness but the mother  replies that he is losing the battle  leonard has a hard time getting handsome  but he succeeds and goes to eat with the  pretty girl  she finds him shaky  but she treats him with respect although  he can barely speak leonard manages to  tell her that he will no longer be able  to see her and tries to leave  but then the pretty girl takes his hand  and begins to dance with him which calms  the unarts tremors that afternoon  leonard walks with difficulty to the  window to see his beloved leave at night  he tries to draw but he cannot control  his hand anymore and that same night he  has to wear diapers again the doctor  watches the videos from when leonard had  first recovered  he says how could people call them kind  if he brought leonard back to life only  to take it away again shortly after the  nurse says that life is given to and  taken from everyone in the world and  then we see that after leonard the other  patients also followed his footsteps  back into lethargy the doctor continues  to preach leonard's legacy of enjoying  the basics in life as we see that the  nurses adjusted to what their patients  liked even after they returned to their  lathargy and that the pretty girl  continued to visit leonard to read books  to him the doctor wrote a novel based on  that experience the same one you can  find in real life under the name  awakenings and the doctor learned  leonard's lesson because he suddenly  dared to ask out the nurse he liked a  text on the screen explains that the  doctor and his team experimented trying  more substances with the patients  achieving small awakenings but none as  great as the one summer of 1969 but the  doctor did not stop communicating with  his patients for this reason as we see  he spoke to leonard again through the  ouija board  the end  if you liked the video please leave a  like and subscribe to continue receiving  recaps of the best drama movies my name  is tc and i'll see you in the next video  bye bye

